"  ╭ Welcome to todoro ───────────────╮  "
"  │ Choose a folder for your todos.  │  "
"  │ Everything goes in it: each      │  "
"  │ workspace is a folder inside,    │  "
"  │ with its todos and notes. todoro │  "
"  │ never backs it up for you, so    │  "
"  │ put it somewhere you back up, or │  "
"  │ copy it yourself.                │  "
